  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Dependency: Azure.AI.OpenAI 2.1.0 -> 2.9.0-beta.1, built for the OpenAI 2.9+ line that Microsoft.Extensions.AI.OpenAI 10.7 requires (OpenAI 2.11). With 2.1.0 a direct ChatClient call on that mix failed at runtime with MissingMethodException (ChatCompletionOptions.get_SerializedAdditionalRawData); AITextAnalyzeService already went through IChatClient since 0.12.0, so this aligns the package graph for host code as well. Hosts no longer need to pin Azure.AI.OpenAI themselves. Azure.AI.OpenAI has no stable release for this line yet, hence the preview dependency. No other changes; Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras and Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.Designer stay at 0.12.0.",
